# Downloaded model weights - ~14 GB, far over GitHub's limits.
# Fetched by the `hf download` commands in DEPLOY_RUNPOD.md section 3.
#
# Leading slash matters: a bare `models/` would also match the vendored library's
# own Qwen3-TTS/qwen_tts/core/models/ and silently drop its source files.
/models/

# Virtual environment - recreate with the steps in DEPLOY_RUNPOD.md
/venv/
/.venv/

# Qwen3-TTS/ is vendored on purpose - see Qwen3-TTS/VENDORED.md. Its build
# artefacts are excluded by the __pycache__/ and *.egg-info/ rules below.

# Generated audio
/test_output/
/saved_voices/
*.wav

# ...but the vocalist library IS part of the project. Sample clips are small and
# make the repo testable out of the box; swap them for your own recordings.
!voices/*.wav

# Secrets and local config
.env
*.pem
*.key

# Logs and scratch
*.log
*.err

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
